# THE RUNTIME ABI PIN (kb/Work PB3610; docs/rearchitecture/DESIGN-external-repository.md section 15.4).
# ⛔ NOBODY EDITS THIS FILE: it is measured. RuntimeAbiPinDriftTests re-measures all four lines on the tree and is red
# when the tree's measurement is not this file. When it moves, decide whether the boundary really changed:
#   python scripts/abi_pin.py bump --runtime-major   a removed or changed public member or a codec image (PublicAPI.Shipped.txt)
#   python scripts/abi_pin.py bump --call-abi        a compiler-side change to what crosses a CALL (RuntimeAbi.CallAbi)
#   python scripts/abi_pin.py repin                  nothing incompatible (a pure rename): say why in the commit
# Each raises the counters in Directory.Build.props <Version> and RuntimeAbi.cs and has the test write the hashes.
# Two branches that both changed this file conflict in plain git (kb/Work PB5110): take main's file, re-apply this
# branch's own bump (the commands above) and let the test measure the merged tree; never merge the hashes by hand.
runtime-major 27
